    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        2200,
        10
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        255
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 9,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这是一个 SDXL LoRA 文生图基础工作流，整体顺序是：底模 -> LoRA -> 尺寸 -> 提示词 -> 采样 -> VAE 解码 -> 保存。\n\n使用前建议先完成三步：\n1. 在 CheckpointLoaderSimple 选择 SDXL 基础模型；\n2. 在 LoraLoader 选择需要的 LoRA；\n3. 先用 batch_size=1 测试，确认显存和风格正常后再放大尺寸或批量。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        2460,
        435
      ],
      "size": [
        355,
        215
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这里加载 SDXL checkpoint，并从中取出 MODEL、CLIP 和 VAE。\n\nCLIPSetLastLayer 当前为 -1，表示不过早截断 CLIP。大多数 SDXL 底模可以直接这样用；若模型作者有特殊说明，再按说明调整。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        2865,
        15
      ],
      "size": [
        360,
        175
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 11,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这里加载 LoRA。strength_model 和 strength_clip 默认都为 1，可作为起点；常见可调范围约 0.6~1.0。\n\nLoRA 过强时容易出现风格压制、细节脏乱或人物特征失真。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        2865,
        760
      ],
      "size": [
        390,
        235
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这个节点负责生成初始 latent，并设置宽高与 batch_size。\n\nSDXL 通常更适合 1024 级别分辨率；如果显存紧张，先保持较小尺寸和 batch_size=1，再逐步往上调。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        3425,
        745
      ],
      "size": [
        410,
        225
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 13,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "上方是正向提示词，下方是负向提示词。SDXL 更吃完整自然语言，建议按“主体 -> 场景 -> 光线 -> 镜头 -> 风格 -> 细节”的顺序写。\n\n负向提示词可以先从 low quality、blurry、deformed、extra fingers 这类基础项开始。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        3895,
        650
      ],
      "size": [
        385,
        220
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 14,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "KSamplerAdvanced 负责正式采样。当前参数可以作为通用起点：20 steps、CFG 2、euler_ancestral、sgm_uniform。\n\n想强化 LoRA 效果时，优先先调 LoRA 强度；想补细节时，再考虑增加步数。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        4335,
        435
      ],
      "size": [
        355,
        170
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 15,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这里使用 checkpoint 输出的 VAE 把 latent 解码成图像。\n\n若出现偏色、灰雾、花屏或解码异常，优先确认底模本身是否带有匹配 VAE。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        4695,
        435
      ],
      "size": [
        355,
        170
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {},
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "这里预览并保存最终图片。filename_prefix 可以改成“项目名/前缀”，ComfyUI 会自动创建子目录。\n\n正式批量生成前，建议先固定 seed 或记录参数，方便复现和比较。"
      ],
      "color": "#223",
      "bgcolor": "#335"
    }
